        <mxCell id="note" value="The software never decides.&#10;It puts facts in front of the guard&#10;and records what the guard decided.&#10;Every path ends in a stored record,&#10;including the ones that found nothing." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
